2124 0 obj
  << /ActualText (AISA is an AI\055powered platform designed to make sign language learning and communication more accessible\056 It helps deaf and hard\055of\055hearing individuals communicate more effectively while also enabling anyone interested in sign language to learn\054 practice\054 and improve their skills through interactive lessons and AI\055powered feedback\056\n\nLed and managed an international remote engineering team across frontend\054 backend and AI\056\nBuilt\054 launched\054 and maintained three major stable versions of the AISA platform across iOS\054 and Android\056\nHelped scale AISA to more than 180\054000 users across the App Store and Google Play\056\nDeveloped and integrated AI\055powered sign language recognition features for real\055time practice and feedback\056\nBuilt and maintained core product infrastructure\054 including authentication\054 analytics\054 and monitoring\056\nImproved production AI accuracy\054 reliability\054 and performance while handling real\055world mobile camera input\056\nBuilt native mobile integrations for camera access\054 notifications\054 Google Sign\055In\054 payments\054 and in\055app experiences\056)
     /K [ 18 ]
     /P 2125 0 R
     /Pg 2088 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
